{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Boole代数"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Boole 代数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Boole 代数是经典逻辑的"},{"Local":{"url":"语法–语义对偶","text":"语义"}},{"Plain":". 如 Boole 代数中的积 (交) 是逻辑与 $X\\wedge Y$, 指数 $Y^X$ 是逻辑蕴含 $X\\Rightarrow Y$, 赋值映射是推理法则 $(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\wedge X \\leq Y$ 等等.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>Boole 代数是具有补运算的"},{"Local":{"url":"分配格","text":"分配格"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Boole 代数与 "},{"Local":{"url":"Boole环","text":"Boole 环"}},{"Plain":"可以相互转化.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>谱</h3>\n<p>记 Boole 代数 $B$ 的<strong>谱</strong>为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}(B) = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Boole}}(B,2).\r\n$$\n则有\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Boole}}(B,2^X) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Set}}(X,\\operatorname{Spec}(B)),\r\n$$\n即函子 $2^{(-)}\\colon \\mathsf{Set}\\to\\mathsf{Boole}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Spec}\\colon \\mathsf{Boole}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 满足"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"关系 $2^{(-)}\\dashv\\operatorname{Spec}$. 这对伴随"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随给出单子","text":"给出的单子"}},{"Plain":"为 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"超滤","text":"超滤单子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>Stone 对偶</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Stone对偶","text":"Stone 对偶"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}